  "display_title": "How To Captivate Your Boss",
  "description": "Jang Gwon-U, the illegitimate youngest son of the powerful Myeonghwa Group, is its one glaring stain—a troublemaker with devilish good looks but little else to recommend him. By his constant side is Hong Se-Ha, his ever-loyal, and workaholic, secretary. She has always genuinely and wholeheartedly assisted him and stood by his side. Against all logic, Se-Ha wanted him. No matter what. But a whispered, \"Kiss me,\" blurs their boundaries, intertwining their bodies. Will Gwon-U and Se-Ha succeed in obtaining their captivating happily-ever-after?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
